      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Feeling disillusioned with your life's potential can be a disorienting experience. It's common to romanticize one's aspirations, only to face the harsh reality of unfulfilled expectations. Acknowledge this feeling, but also remember that feeling stuck or unfulfilled doesn't define your entire existence. You have the capacity to reassess, adjust, and find meaning in your life's path, even if it's \"only\" ordinary.",
