      "content": "\"ordinary\" is just a nice way of saying useless. i've spent so much time grinding, sacrificing everything to be at the top, just to realize i'm capped. it feels like i've been running a race only to find out the finish line was a wall. staying in this \"ordinary\" lane feels like just waiting to die, really. it's pathetic.",
